{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261018/photo/bkn-20261018121912763-1018_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261018141208\"/><p>現場為富韻樓一單位。(馬竟峯攝)</p><p>深水埗有人暈倒。今晨(18日)11時40分，一名男子報案，指其女外傭在富昌邨富韻樓一單位內暈倒，身旁有一把風扇，懷疑她觸電。救援人員接報到場，發現女子暈倒昏迷，幸仍有呼吸脈搏，遂將事主交由救護車急送明愛醫院搶救，女子暈倒原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:39:31.458640+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:19:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:37:47.350086+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:37:44.066018+00:00","content_hash":"f9b7cc165e45b28fea64e36a30cef46784bb311bce3a46f3241bcf1701e935b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}